569 0 obj
<<
/Title (Traditional IT infrastructure monitoring systems such as Nagios and Zabbix continuously track CPU, memory, disk, network, and system performance using predefined thresholds, but they have limited intelligent diagnosis capabilities.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 473 0 R
/Next 624 0 R
>>
endobj
570 0 obj
<<
/Title (The proposed system extends these approaches by integrating real-time endpoint monitoring, AI-based anomaly detection, automated incident management, duplicate incident detection, root-cause analysis, and predictive maintenance into a unified platform.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 473 0 R
/Prev 625 0 R
/First 626 0 R
